{"product_id":"you-dont-have-to-like-me","title":"You don't have to like me","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"The author of Don't Worry It Gets Worse takes on the F-word   Alida Nugent's first book, Don't Worry, It Gets Worse, received terrific reviews, and her self-deprecating \"everygirl\" approach continues to win the Internet-savvy writer and blogger new fans. Now, she takes on one of today's hottest cultural topics: feminism.  Nugent is a proud feminist--and she's not afraid to say it. From the \"scarlet F\" thrust upon you if you declare yourself a feminist at a party to how to handle judgmental store clerks when you buy Plan B, You Don't Have to Like Me skewers a range of cultural issues, and confirms Nugent as a star on the rise\"-- \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 210  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Nugent Alida \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780142181683 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44612451008665,"sku":"5RA9780142181683","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/c131f493a70fc88893075ae968559f20.jpg?v=1721227967","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/you-dont-have-to-like-me","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}